 "titulo": "Venice stands on wood that never rots 🇮🇹 #howitworks #shorts",
 "capa": "A CITY ON WOODEN STICKS",
 "descripcion": "Venice stands on millions of wooden piles. Wood in the ground should rot in years, but these have lasted centuries.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#howitworks #engineering #venice #science #shorts",
 "tags": [
